[{"_id":"6a8c705718643fbd8e599dc9","id":"csoai/eldorado-eval-results","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Eldorado — signed measurement receipts","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"data/measurements.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:38:58.000Z","likes":1,"trendingScore":1,"private":false,"sha":"97b0a5b43040e9f208762ce03b28c5b9e16ec73e","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEldorado — signed measurement receipts\n\t\n\nSigned measurement receipts. Each row of data/measurements.jsonl carries the\nregistry the measurement was taken against, the subject model and its subject_digest, the\nmeasured_count out of total_count and the resulting ratio, a content_hash over the payload, the\nreceipt_content_id, the anchor_time, and the DID that signed it\n(did:web:csoai.org#card-attestation-1). A ratio here is coverage of a registry, not an axis score.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/eldorado-eval-results.","downloads":224,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-24T16:24:55.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a6f43ec38c3db386615ecb1","id":"csoai/aiact-frozen-split-harness","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"EU AI Act scenarios — frozen split harness","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"scenarios.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:38:41.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"51332aeabdbd25d01113306e9dae6b75ffae8757","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEU AI Act scenarios — frozen split harness\n\t\n\nEU AI Act deployment scenarios with their obligations, as a frozen split.\nEach row of scenarios.jsonl carries role (Provider / Deployer), intended_use, system_type,\ninput_data, domain, a related_articles list of AI Act article numbers, and the obligations that\nfollow. results/ holds the run outputs from the harness passes that used this split.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the authority\n\t\n\n\n\n\nGET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — quote… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/aiact-frozen-split-harness.","downloads":262,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-02T13:19:40.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a701594c47d65fb1ece4324","id":"csoai/coai-bench","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"COAI — EU AI Act tiering disagreement corpus","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"sov_signal.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:38:49.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"83c037647fe03b0e4a32331318590f71f94205f3","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCOAI — EU AI Act tiering disagreement corpus\n\t\n\nA disagreement-mining corpus over EU AI Act tiering. Each row of sov_signal.jsonl\ncarries a scenario, the law_truth tier (PROHIBITED / HIGH_RISK / …), the anchor article that\nsettles it, what the local sov34 model answered and whether it was right, what a frontier model answered\nand whether it was right, a disagreement flag and a training_value grade. The value is in the rows where\nthe two disagree — that is where the tiering is… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/coai-bench.","downloads":313,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-03T04:14:12.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a701596b7db3a05090a4431","id":"csoai/compbench","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"CompBench — per-category capability sweeps","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_ca