edde4d2e883714a76f666ae8eb9c26b5e187","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tArena probe matrices\n\t\n\nPer-run probe matrices from the arena lane. Each arena_matrix_*.json records the\nbenchmark, the run_at timestamp, the base endpoint and the lane it ran on (local Ollama, £0), then a\nsummary giving n_measured, n_correct and accuracy for every model in that round. The n per cell is\nsmall and stated; read them as probes, not as board measurements.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the authority\n\t\n\n\n\n\nGET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — quote totals.public_count.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/arena-matrices.","downloads":203,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","arena"],"createdAt":"2026-08-03T04:14:16.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a702240e25f5b8d4f9a5fac","id":"csoai/gspc-care","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"GSPC — care bank (CareBench)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","care","family-gspc","carebench","llm-evaluation","frozen-bank","model-comparison"],"task_categories":["question-answering","text-generation"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"items.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"axis_live","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"axis-live.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:39:15.000Z","likes":0,"