,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","board","signed"],"createdAt":"2026-08-23T09:17:24.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a8abbc62bc15bf4b0ea22d3","id":"csoai/gspc-sim-cards","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Smoke-test simulation cards (no inference)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["1K<n<10K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"sim_cards.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:39:46.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"823f647fcf8471f1b9e1501a4a190c4a9e26fc96","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSmoke-test simulation cards (no inference)\n\t\n\nSimulated cards from the smoke-test harness — no model inference happened. Each row\nof sim_cards.jsonl carries the card file, timestamp, axis, the question q, a canned policy answer a\n(\"Policy applied by smoke-test with calibrated confidence 0.60\"), an answer hash ah and a signed flag.\nPublished so the harness's plumbing is auditable; these are not measurements and must never be pooled\nwith a bank.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-sim-cards.","downloads":256,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:json","modality:text","l