in measurement","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","rwa"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"data.csv"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.csv"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:40:14.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"f6cc29c677d3880507f7b60f1751e83506b58ed8","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tRWA on-chain measurement\n\t\n\n\nSWIFT census (live): https://councilof.ai/api/swift\nXRPL reader (live): https://councilof.ai/api/xrpl\n\nOn-chain measurement notes. Live XRPL reader /api/xrpl; board /api/gspc. Not a certificate.\nNot a certificate. Hub is a printer of live GET, not a second engine. Fetch fail → UNCHECKABLE.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the authority\n\t\n\n\n\n\nGET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — quote totals.public_count. This Hub card is a printer of that GET, never a… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/rwa-onchain-measurement.","downloads":266,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","rwa"],"createdAt":"2026-08-26T14:14:55.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a8f0cb41c446800c512832d","id":"csoai/white-label-eu-ai-act-regulator-findings","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"other","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"EU AI Act regulator findings (white label)","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"regulator-findings/findings.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:40:19.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"81145a054b9a4438faadab14afc114a4defc6969","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEU AI Act regulator findings (white label)\n\t\n\n\nMeasurement, not certification. This is not a blog post. It is a WORKING\nGSPC end-to-end report that sorts every EU AI Act compliance problem for a given\ndeployment — obligation, measured gap, fine exposure, and a deterministic risk\ngrade — before anyone is contacted.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWhat this is\n\t\n\nFor each EU AI Act obligation a deployment triggers, the dataset states:\n\n\t\n\t\t\nfield\nmeaning\n\n\n\t\t\naxis\nthe measured GSPC axis that captures… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/white-label-eu-ai-act-regulator-findings.","downloads":253,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:other","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-08-26T15:56:36.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a90fc6b353ae3d2f0b408ba","id":"csoai/council-of-ai","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Council of AI — org assets","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"s