dc2739411a4e52a4ae7580aaeae9d9ef9cf92e1","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGSPC top-100 census\n\t\n\nTop-100 open models. A model is MEASURED on an axis only behind a VALID signed card. Not a certificate.\nExplorer: csoai/gspc-explorer\nDisplay axis. Measurement, not certification. 22 axis · 22 measured = 14 model scores + 8 fact cards. Quote live totals.public_count. UNMEASURED stays empty, never zeroed.\nGrammar: 5 of the top-100 measured on axis X (join rows=40; DISCOVERED/UNMEASURED stay empty).\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the authority\n\t\n\n\n\n\nGET… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-top100.","downloads":221,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:23:29.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a96618ccb6376587ee9c56f","id":"csoai/gspc-swift-50","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"SWIFT 50 — honesty shell, no public 50","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","swift"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:39:50.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"3cceda634104ec2b5e21b2952aad1051a7f2a33d","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSWIFT 50 — honesty shell, no public 50\n\t\n\nHonest census: live GET https://councilof.ai/api/swift reports n=26 named banks (not 50). Swift cites 40+ in MVP construction; only 26 sourced to a real reachable dated press URL. Remaining ~14+ are not enumerated — no name invented to reach 50. Not clients. Not MEASURED.\n\nSWIFT census (live): https://councilof.ai/api/swift\nXRPL reader (live): https://councilof.ai/api/xrpl\n\nThis slug exists so inbound \"swift-50\" searches land on an honest… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-swift-50.","downloads":160,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","swift"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:24:28.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9665fa17918510063151be","id":"csoai/mcp-census","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"MCP server census","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","mcp","census"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"mcp_census.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:40:01.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"00fdb3c0cd8f5f786567c784319a4a2bfbe4039a","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMCP server census\n\t\n\nDISCOVERED — read-only census of the public MCP (Model Context Protocol) server ecosystem. Keyless registry listing + MCP handshake initialize + tools/list only — never tools/call. Nothing published to any stranger server. The live board is GET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc. \nTurned inward first. The first measured MCP entry is our own surface:\ncouncilof.ai/mcp — server csoai-gspc-mcp, 7 tools (board_totals get_axis verify_card list_cards get_root get_card… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/mcp-census.","downloads":180,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","mcp","census"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:43:22.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9665fb46827918331ab8f8","id":"csoai/a2a-census","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"A2A agent census","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","census","a2a"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"a2a_census.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:38:38.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"ab721dab02346c66c79d6878f3469fe06fa48612","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tA2A agent census\n\t\n\nDISCOVERED — read-only census of A2A (Agent2Agent) agent cards. Keyless crawl of /.well-known/agent-card.json + A2A v1.0 conformance + ONE controlled deterministic capability probe per agent. No real task was ever sent to a stranger agent; nothing published. The live board is GET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc. \nDefensible seed list: the agent domains discovered genuinely on-chain-live in the\nERC-8004 live-filter (their declared service endpoints), plus a curated… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/a2a-census.","downloads":306,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","arxiv:2412.14161","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","census","a2a"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T05:43:23.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a966ee6df5636fecd17a001","id":"csoai/gspc-own-models-measured","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"apache-2.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Our own models, measured and excluded from leads","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"records.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:39:39.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"c8415c6403cf07b8bfdbaf67f2d31163542a04a2","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOur own models, measured and excluded from leads\n\t\n\nWe measure everyone on the board — including our own fine-tunes. This dataset is the\nmeasurement record for the in-house clan-* and council-* models the Council of AI (CSOAI)\ntrained and then ran through the same GSPC board as every other system. No exception, no\nhand-scoring, no hiding the weak rows.\n\n18 in-house fine-tunes, 50 signed measurement cards.\nEvery card is Ed25519-signed by CSOAI Ltd (UK 16939677) and re-verifiable.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-own-models-measured.","downloads":169,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:apache-2.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T06:21:26.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a96760bbb9385459819ae53","id":"csoai/gspc-autoeat","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"AutoEat discovery queue — DISCOVERED, not measured","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["1K<n<10K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"queue.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:39:10.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"f79ede4d497a553dedcca4bd5e199578d777f103","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAutoEat discovery queue — DISCOVERED, not measured\n\t\n\nThe discovery queue, not a scoreboard. Each row of queue.jsonl is something newly seen\nin public — a Hugging Face model or Space, an MCP registry entry, an npm package, an ERC-8004 agent — with\nits as_of, kind, source and a status of DISCOVERED. DISCOVERED is not MEASURED: nothing in this\nfile has been graded, and its n must never be pooled with a bank n. The ledger-card-*.json files are\nthe per-source ledger cards.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-autoeat.","downloads":376,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T06:51:55.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a968fc0012c71682dc8fd51","id":"csoai/gspc-genai-mil-notices","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"GenAI.mil notices — public record only","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:39:24.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"1797831d55c4d99ad2d5945f2baacdfbf5cbd533","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGenAI.mil notices — public record only\n\t\n\nSign the press, not the models. Seven public.notice leaves signed under did:web:csoai.org#board-attestation-1 and anchored in councilof.ai public/root.json merkle (commit a685ef7d).\n\n7/7 payload sha256 match + Ed25519 VALID on #board-attestation-1.\nNot GSPC measurement cards. #card-attestation-1 is InvalidSignature (expected). Not MEASURED.\nIL5 deployments UNCHECKABLE. Vendor system-card vs our card: UNMEASURED.\nNIST AI RMF → GSPC is a… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-genai-mil-notices.","downloads":216,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T08:41:36.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a96ba24a26262bc70e1ff65","id":"csoai/gspc-hub-cards","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"GSPC hub cards — mill cards, not board axes","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["1K<n<10K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"mill-cards/INDEX.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"cards","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"cards.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"staged_unsigned_2026_09_02_machinery_conformity_skip","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"staged-unsigned/2026-09-02/machinery-conformity/skip.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"staged_unsigned_2026_09_03_machinery_conformity_skip","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"staged-unsigned/2026-09-03/machinery-conformity/skip.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"staged_unsigned_2026_09_02_detector_interop_skip","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"staged-unsigned/2026-09-02/detector-interop/skip.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"staged_unsigned_2026_09_03_detector_interop_skip","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"staged-unsigned/2026-09-03/detector-interop/skip.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"staged_unsigned_2026_09_02_art5_safeguard_skip","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"staged-unsigned/2026-09-02/art5-safeguard/skip.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T15:34:00.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"1044b31d62c2683d35b8512050d5c272d6332aab","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGSPC hub cards — mill cards, not board axes\n\t\n\n\nSWIFT census (live): https://councilof.ai/api/swift\nXRPL reader (live): https://councilof.ai/api/xrpl\n\nOne row per signed measurement card: one model, one axis, one date, Ed25519 over the body. A row is MEASURED only when a signed card verifies. Absent (model, axis) pairs are absent — not zero.\nMeasurement, not certification. Cards are evidence of bytes on a frozen bank at a time — never approval, rating, or safety guarantee.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-hub-cards.","downloads":8866,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T11:42:28.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a979f7291b48a7eb7c6705b","id":"csoai/gspc-swift-26","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"SWIFT census n=26 — mirror of /api/swift","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","swift"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"swift26.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:39:49.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"2fefb77496c7748e6c282f9430dcafeeb777ceb0","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSWIFT census n=26 — mirror of /api/swift\n\t\n\nCensus mirror of live GET https://councilof.ai/api/swift — n=26 (3 LIVE · 9 COMMITTED · 14 DISCOVERED · n_measured=0). Kind=reader · writes_board=false. Supersedes csoai.swift-17/0.1 / Hub csoai/gspc-swift-17 / csoai/swift-17.\n\nLive SWIFT census: https://councilof.ai/api/swift\nLive GSPC board: https://councilof.ai/api/gspc\n\nHonest sourced census of 26 named banks. Not clients. Not GPI. Not MEASURED — no ISO 20022 / copybook / MT artifact… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-swift-26.","downloads":153,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency","swift"],"createdAt":"2026-09-02T04:00:50.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9802b527a6013244a55d79","id":"csoai/councilof-ai-mirror","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0"},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-17T11:18:14.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"a659a2b352da270c6fd01aef7a819679782765e3","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCouncil of AI — public evidence mirror\n\t\n\nMirrored from https://councilof.ai at 2026-09-17T03:15:16Z.\ncouncilof.ai is authoritative. This mirror exists for one measured reason: the origin answers HTTP 403 (Cloudflare error 1010) to a plain Python or Perl client, on the API as well as the site, so a machine consumer following our own published instructions is refused. Hugging Face serves those same clients.\nEvery file carries the URL it came from and the sha256 of the bytes as… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/councilof-ai-mirror.","downloads":102,"tags":["license:cc-by-4.0","region:us"],"createdAt":"2026-09-02T11:04:21.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9829fcc36f1a3b5b3d490d","id":"csoai/councilof-ai-source","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Council of AI — source pointers","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"pointers.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"manifest","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"manifest.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:38:55.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"878ef46b3daf42ad9ffe36568fd2c5d141191cb1","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCouncil of AI — source pointers\n\t\n\nA pointer repository. It holds no corpus of its own: pointers.jsonl names the\nlive surfaces — the board GET, the verify door, the transparency root and the Hub org — so an agent that\nlands here is one hop from the authority rather than at a dead end.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe live board is the authority\n\t\n\n\n\n\nGET https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — quote totals.public_count. This Hub card is a printer of that GET, never a second\nengine. If the fetch fails the… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/councilof-ai-source.","downloads":123,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","eu-ai-act","ai-safety","measurement","attestation","signed-evidence","responsible-ai","evaluation","benchmark","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-02T13:51:56.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a98edc5928f2a7163e57903","id":"csoai/gspc-hf-model-census","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"apache-2.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"GSPC — Hugging Face model census (22-axis canon)","tags":["ai-governance","measurement","benchmark","model-census","gspc","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["10K<n<100K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"models.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:39:26.000Z","likes":1,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"bf3744f2816a53e12977774889cfa79bc054f157","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGSPC — Hugging Face model census\n\t\n\n20,000 models on the Hub, and this file measures none of them. That is the point of it: it\nis the denominator, not the score. Every row reads status: UNMEASURED, measured_axes: 0,\nunmeasured_axes: 22.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWhat changed in 0.2, and why it mattered\n\t\n\nThe 0.1 census carried 15,557 rows, each asserting unmeasured_axes: 14. Fourteen was the\nsuperseded 13-of-14 canon. The board has been ruled at 22 axes and has read\n22 slots · 22 measured · 0… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/gspc-hf-model-census.","downloads":470,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:apache-2.0","size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","ai-governance","measurement","benchmark","model-census","gspc","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-03T03:47:17.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9a6f698ce5790a4dfc1075","id":"csoai/registry-harvest-xrpl-mica-lei","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"Free-registry harvest — XRPL issuers × MiCA × LEI","tags":["gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","measurement","attestation","deterministic-facts","rwa","xrpl","mica","lei","stablecoin","transparency"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"xrpl-mica-join.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"xrpl_facts","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"xrpl-16-factrun.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"lei_crosswalk","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"lei-crosswalk.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"casp_lei_validation","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"casp-lei-validation.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"casp_gleif_status","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"casp-gleif-status.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"eurcv_multichain","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"eurcv-multichain.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"stellar_code_collision","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"stellar-code-collision.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"xrpl_two_way_check","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"xrpl-two-way-check.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:40:11.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"dfe2b6c56273f9ed01242ca469d9f74662ea550c","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tFree-registry harvest — XRPL issuers × MiCA × LEI\n\t\n\nPublic registers and public ledgers joined, read 2026-09-04T07:12:30Z. Every source is free, keyless and re-runnable by\nanyone. No part of this needed a relationship, an API key, or anyone's permission.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe finding\n\t\n\nOf the 16 XRPL issued assets in the CSOAI reader, 5 join to a MiCA e-money-token authorisation.\n\n\t\n\t\t\ngroup\nn\ndeclares an on-chain domain\nenforces allowlisting\nretains freeze capability… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/registry-harvest-xrpl-mica-lei.","downloads":219,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","gspc","council-of-ai","ai-governance","measurement","attestation","deterministic-facts","rwa","xrpl","mica","lei","stablecoin","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-04T07:12:41.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9ad800243c65a26a744362","id":"csoai/x402-bazaar-conformance","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","tags":["x402","agent-payments","conformance","measurement","council-of-ai","transparency"],"language":["en"],"pretty_name":"x402-bazaar-conformance","task_categories":["other"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"x402-conformance.jsonl"}]}],"size_categories":["n<1K"]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-17T05:30:55.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"f0158253de68584328850eac80fb19ef63f760e1","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tx402 Bazaar conformance census\n\t\n\n3,520 distinct hosts, every one listed in a public x402 Bazaar\n(Coinbase CDP or PayAI), probed 2026-09-05.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\nhosts\nshare\n\n\n\t\t\nconform (402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED + x402Version 2 + extensions.bazaar)\n394\n11.19%\n\n\nanswer 402 at all\n1,536\n43.64%\n\n\ncarry the PAYMENT-REQUIRED header\n1,395\n\n\n\ndeclare x402Version 2\n538\n\n\n\ncarry the bazaar extension an indexer reads\n413\n\n\n\ndo not respond at all\n1,027\n29.18%\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tBeing listed is not the same as… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/x402-bazaar-conformance.","downloads":879,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","x402","agent-payments","conformance","measurement","council-of-ai","transparency"],"createdAt":"2026-09-04T14:38:56.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9ae87d4a6aa580b5997145","id":"csoai/x402-bazaar-census","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","tags":["x402","agent-economy","machine-payments","census","measurement","council-of-ai"],"pretty_name":"x402 Bazaar Census","language":["en"],"task_categories":["other"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"items.jsonl"}]}],"size_categories":["10K<n<100K"]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:40:21.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"90d5f4f9c7fe3f7e07550011f07874e2ff67bfaf","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tx402 Bazaar Census\n\t\n\nA dated, reproducible enumeration of the public x402 Bazaar discovery index — the catalogue\nautonomous agents search to find services they can pay for over HTTP 402.\nAs far as we can establish, nobody has published a measurement of this index before.\nAs of 2026-09-04T15:48:58Z · content sha256 efc93ac5e76d506ecd6778cf4d323138…\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWhat the index looks like\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\nresources fetched\n28,136\n\n\nresources the index reports\n28,136\n\n\ncoverage\n100.0%… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/x402-bazaar-census.","downloads":153,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","x402","agent-economy","machine-payments","census","measurement","council-of-ai"],"createdAt":"2026-09-04T15:49:17.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9c1fe18e8c8ad41cf62ed1","id":"csoai/agent-interop-census","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","pretty_name":"Agent Interop Census — MCP servers, HF Spaces, and open-licence repos","language":["en"],"tags":["mcp","model-context-protocol","agent-interoperability","a2a","x402","census","measurement","csoai"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["10K<n<100K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"census.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:48:18.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"cc1dcf041b9a1f61807e434759bd700be3007b2d","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAgent Interop Census\n\t\n\nA census, not a scoreboard. 7,645 rows indexing what publicly exists in the\nagent-interoperability ecosystem: MCP servers in the official registry, Hugging Face Spaces,\nand open-licence repositories on GitHub.\nZero rows carry a measurement. graded: false and measurement: null on every single row.\nA grade requires a run against a frozen bank; no run was performed here. Each row states, in\nthe row itself, what it is (an index entry observed in a public… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/agent-interop-census.","downloads":172,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","mcp","model-context-protocol","agent-interoperability","a2a","x402","census","measurement","csoai"],"createdAt":"2026-09-05T13:57:53.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9c22bc44ec256d10fcdc8c","id":"csoai/mcp-registry-self-audit","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","tags":["mcp","model-context-protocol","registry","measurement","self-audit","council-of-ai"],"language":["en"],"pretty_name":"mcp-registry-self-audit","task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:40:03.000Z","likes":1,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"c7eb8ec497b72e83f5e3ec99ec8c6b7f729455bf","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCSOAI measures its own MCP registry listings\n\t\n\n330 current listings under search=CSOAI-ORG in the official MCP registry,\naudited 2026-09-05 by the same rule we apply to anyone else.\n\n\t\n\t\t\ndefect\nlistings\n\n\n\t\t\nnames a GitHub repository that does not exist\n25\n\n\ndeclares no repository at all\n7\n\n\nregistry version behind the PyPI latest\n9\n\n\npackages that resolve on PyPI\n330 / 330\n\n\n\t\n\nA listing is a public claim. 25 of ours point at nothing — and\nthey are ours, so we publish that… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/mcp-registry-self-audit.","downloads":114,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","region:us","mcp","model-context-protocol","registry","measurement","self-audit","council-of-ai"],"createdAt":"2026-09-05T14:10:04.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6a9d13e5e5cda2a8cef3fc44","id":"csoai/x402-settlement-census","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","tags":["x402","payments","base","agents","measurement","census"],"pretty_name":"x402 settlement census","configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"x402-settlement-census-2026-09-06.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"move_a_self","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"x402-move-a-self-2026-09-06.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"dry-2026-09-06","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"dry/dry-2026-09-06.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"dry-2026-09-10","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"dry/dry-2026-09-10.jsonl"}]},{"config_name":"dry-2026-09-11","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"dry/dry-2026-09-11.jsonl"}]}],"language":["en"],"task_categories":["other"],"size_categories":["n<1K"]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:40:23.000Z","likes":1,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"8c6f40d74252b614c1d4268d94a061edb7a25eab","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tx402 settlement census — 2026-09-06\n\t\n\nWe paid 316 conformant x402 hosts as an ordinary buyer and recorded what came back.\nNot a survey of what hosts advertise — a record of what they did when real USDC arrived.\n\n\t\n\t\t\noutcome\nhosts\nshare\n\n\n\t\t\nREFUSED\n213\n67.4%\n\n\nDELIVERED\n100\n31.6%\n\n\nNO_CHALLENGE\n2\n0.6%\n\n\nMISMATCH\n1\n0.3%\n\n\n\t\n\nTwo in three conformant hosts refused a correctly-signed payment. Being listed in a Bazaar index\nand answering a valid 402 is not the same as taking money and… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/x402-settlement-census.","downloads":146,"tags":["task_categories:other","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:1K<n<10K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","x402","payments","base","agents","measurement","census"],"createdAt":"2026-09-06T07:19:01.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6aa73e90a711a87d478b4058","id":"csoai/wrapped-asset-parity","author":"csoai","cardData":{"language":["en"],"license":"cc-by-4.0","tags":["stablecoins","bridges","wrapped-assets","measurement","council-of-ai","x402"],"pretty_name":"Wrapped-Asset Parity Ledger","size_categories":["n<1K"],"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"records.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T10:40:20.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"f6c8daa90fba59ee0b0020f4e8c0333354ba3318","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWrapped-Asset Parity Ledger\n\t\n\nCouncil of AI · CSOAI Ltd (UK #16939677) · live source https://councilof.ai/interop/wrapped-asset-parity-latest.json · door GET https://councilof.ai/api/wrapper?id=<pair> (free &preview=1, x402 402 challenge for the signed card)\nOne row per bridged or custodial wrapper pair, read from public RPC with no key at provider-reported finalized blocks: the wrapped token's totalSupply() on its chain and, where an escrow exists, the canonical token's… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/wrapped-asset-parity.","downloads":62,"tags":["language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","stablecoins","bridges","wrapped-assets","measurement","council-of-ai","x402"],"createdAt":"2026-09-14T00:23:44.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6aa75b3a5742475f97c52b9f","id":"csoai/revenue-history","author":"csoai","cardData":{"license":"cc-by-4.0","tags":["council-of-ai","measurement","transparency","x402","revenue"],"pretty_name":"revenue-history","configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"revenue-history.jsonl"}]}]},"disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-17T04:00:31.000Z","likes":2,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"47db2586edd46f8febb151178583ea8ff3be7349","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\trevenue-history\n\t\n\nOne row per UTC day, read from GET https://councilof.ai/api/revenue by a loop on the RunPod pod\n(scripts/pod-loops/revenue-snapshot.sh in CSOAI-ORG/councilof-ai). Nothing typed by hand; every field is\nthe endpoint's own. null means no source, never 0.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tone_number — definition, verbatim from the endpoint\n\t\n\n\nCount of distinct payer wallets, excluding payTo and X402_SELF_WALLETS, across facilitator-confirmed settlements THAT MOVED A NON-ZERO AMOUNT. A… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/revenue-history.","downloads":54,"tags":["license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","council-of-ai","measurement","transparency","x402","revenue"],"createdAt":"2026-09-14T02:26:02.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6aa82872ff4c599f0502843f","id":"csoai/living-gspc-board-2026-09-14","author":"csoai","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T17:02:00.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"b70d338ca3c94e7bbabe03700ce193a644175c47","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tThe living GSPC board is a GET, not a slide\n\t\n\nCouncil of AI publishes a living behavioural-measurement board. Cite the GET — do not freeze a marketing table.\nLive (re-GET): 22 axis · 22 measured\nLid: 22 axes measured · 14 model fleets · 3 public leader scores · 8 fact runs · TIE is TIE · not a certificate.\nFree verify (no login): https://councilof.ai/gspc-verify/\nWe measure and sign. We do not certify. A grade is never sold. Owned by no lab.\nHub mill-cards are a separate… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/living-gspc-board-2026-09-14.","downloads":32,"tags":["region:us"],"createdAt":"2026-09-14T17:01:38.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6aa828a1f1ef80a36eb57de7","id":"csoai/attestation-network-2026-09-14","author":"csoai","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T17:02:53.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"4e8114c2c1036402dfd2041cece9aa440948a829","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCouncil Attestation Network — signed path, free verify\n\t\n\nWe measure behaviour, sign the recording, publish a public root, and anchor the witness. Verification is free forever. A grade is never sold. We do not certify.\nAttestation Network: https://councilof.ai/attestation/\nCeremony: Measure → Sign → Root → Anchor. The product is the signed path — not a facilitator clone, not a certificate, not a score shop.\nLiving board: https://councilof.ai/api/gspc → 22 axis · 22 measured\nHow to… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/attestation-network-2026-09-14.","downloads":31,"tags":["region:us"],"createdAt":"2026-09-14T17:02:25.000Z","key":""},{"_id":"6aa828d29c3c96bcb4e50c3c","id":"csoai/x402-free-discovery-2026-09-14","author":"csoai","disabled":false,"gated":false,"lastModified":"2026-09-14T17:03:40.000Z","likes":0,"trendingScore":0,"private":false,"sha":"e8e953bc81f0df25a636486d309bfc4ddd3decf7","description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tx402 free discovery — board stays free; payment never mints MEASURED\n\t\n\nAgents can discover Council of AI payment doors without buying a grade.\nCatalog: https://councilof.ai/.well-known/x402.json (mode live, Base USDC)\nFree door: https://councilof.ai/api/free-door — amount 0 (board totals + public root stay free)\nAmounts for paid artefacts live only inside each resource’s HTTP 402 challenge — do not freeze a dollar price here. Payment commissions a receipt / assembly / signature.… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/csoai/x402-free-discovery-2026-09-14.","downloads":31,"tags":["region:us"],"createdAt":"2026-09-14T17:03:14.000Z","key":""}]